~ Chests
freebie_refresh_chance_desc(String): The chance for a Freebie to become claimable again immediately after being claimed.
freebie_refresh_chance(String): freebie_refresh_chance
freebie_cooldown_seconds_desc(String): The cooldown in between Freebie claims. (Base: 10 minutes.)
freebie_cooldown_seconds(String): freebie_cooldown_seconds
ultra_stonks_chance_desc(String): The chance for a Super Stonks roll to become an Ultra Stonks roll.
ultra_stonks_chance(String): ultra_stonks_chance
freebie_bank_cap_desc(String): How many Freebies you can accumulate before claiming them. (Base: 2.)
freebie_bank_cap(String): freebie_bank_cap
stonks_chance_desc(String): The chance for a Freebie to roll a Stonks reward when claimed. The chance is rolled once for item chests, relic chests and gems. You can get multiple different rewards from a single freebie.
stonks_chance(String): stonks_chance
ultra_stonks_multi_desc(String): The multiplier to rewards when Ultra Stonks procs. The All Stonks Multi is factored into the displayed amount. (Base: 25x)
ultra_stonks_multi(String): ultra_stonks_multi
super_stonks_chance_desc(String): The chance for a "Stonks!" roll to become a Super Stonks roll.
super_stonks_chance(String): super_stonks_chance
freebie_5x_chance_desc(String): Rolls 4 extra times for normal Freebie loot and the bonus Relic Chest
freebie_5x_chance(String): freebie_5x_chance
chest_items_bonus_desc(String): How many Items you receive when you open an Item Chest.
chest_items_bonus(String): chest_items_bonus
stonks_multi_desc(String): The multiplier to base Stonks rewards. The All Stonks Multi is factored into the displayed amount. (Base: 1x)
stonks_multi(String): stonks_multi
freebie_gems_bonus_desc(String): How many gems you receive from a Freebie Pack (base 5).
freebie_gems_bonus(String): freebie_gems_bonus
super_stonks_multi_desc(String): The multiplier to rewards when Super Stonks procs. The All Stonks Multi is factored into the displayed amount. (Base: 2x)
super_stonks_multi(String): super_stonks_multi
chest_meter_multi_desc(String): How quickly the Item and Relic Chest meters fill up. Actually functions by reducing the damage requirement.
chest_meter_multi(String): chest_meter_multi
chest_double_chance_desc(String): The chance to receive 2 Item and Relic Chests when the respective bar fills up.
chest_double_chance(String): chest_double_chance

