lootfrog_loot_multi_desc(String): The multiplier to loot from Lootfrogs.
lootfrog_loot_multi(String): lootfrog_loot_multi
lootfrog_triple_spawn_chance_desc(String): The chance for 3 Lootfrogs to spawn in place of 1.
lootfrog_triple_spawn_chance(String): lootfrog_triple_spawn_chance
lootfrog_golden_chance_desc(String): The chance for a Lootfrog to appear as a Golden Lootfrog.
lootfrog_golden_chance(String): lootfrog_golden_chance
lootfrog_massive_chance: lootfrog_massive_chance
lootfrog_massive_chance_desc: The chance for a Big Lootfrog to spawn as a Massive Lootfrog instead.

