pickaxe_attack_speed_per_second_desc(String): How many times per second you deal pickaxe damage while holding.
pickaxe_attack_speed_per_second(String): pickaxe_attack_speed_per_second
pickaxe_super_crit_chance_desc(String): The amount to multiply your damage by when Super Crit Chance triggers.
pickaxe_super_crit_chance(String): pickaxe_super_crit_chance
pickaxe_ultra_crit_chance_desc(String): The amount to multiply your damage by when Pickaxe Ultra Crit Chance triggers.
pickaxe_ultra_crit_chance(String): pickaxe_ultra_crit_chance
pickaxe_crit_chance_desc(String): The chance to multiply your damage by Pickaxe Crit Damage.
pickaxe_crit_chance(String): pickaxe_crit_chance
pickaxe_ultra_crit_damage_desc(String): The amount to multiply your damage by when Pickaxe Ultra Crit Chance triggers.
pickaxe_ultra_crit_damage(String): pickaxe_ultra_crit_damage
pickaxe_omega_crit_chance_desc(String): The chance to multiply your damage by Pickaxe Omega Crit Damage. Only rolls when Pickaxe Ultra Crit Chance activates.
pickaxe_omega_crit_chance(String): pickaxe_omega_crit_chance
pickaxe_super_crit_damage_desc(String): The amount to multiply your damage by when Super Crit Chance triggers.
pickaxe_super_crit_damage(String): pickaxe_super_crit_damage
pickaxe_damage_desc(String): How much damage you do when holding the screen. It's the only way to deal damage to Obelisks. Obelisk Armor is subtracted from your Pickaxe Damage before crits are calculated. If you have less Pickaxe Damage than the Obelisk has Armor, you will always do 0 damage regardless of crits. Drone Damage is based on Pickaxe Damage.
pickaxe_damage(String): pickaxe_damage

